'''Version 1.0''' was the initial version of [[Nyanko Daisensou]], the updated re-release of [[Ganso!! Nyanko Daisensou]]. All content from Ganso!! Nyanko Daisensou was carried over to this version.

==Release Dates==
*'''Japanese:''' November 15th, 2012
*'''English:''' September 16th, 2014
*'''Taiwanese:''' August 26th, 2015
*'''Korean:'''  September 17th, 2014

